---
// CalibrationGuide.astro
---

<section class="py-12 sm:py-16 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-900/10 via-(--card) to-cyan-900/10 border border-(--border) rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-sm">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mb-10">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-600 dark:text-cyan-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
        Panduan Praktis
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-(--foreground) tracking-tight">
        Cara Kalibrasi & Mengukur Benda dengan Layar HP
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-(--muted-foreground)">
        Ikuti 3 langkah mudah berikut untuk mendapatkan hasil pengukuran fisik yang 100% presisi layaknya memakai penggaris mistar besi:
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-600 text-white font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-md shadow-indigo-600/30">
            1
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-(--foreground)">Tempelkan Kartu Kalibrasi</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-(--muted-foreground) leading-relaxed">
          Klik tombol <strong>"Kalibrasi"</strong> di bagian atas. Siapkan kartu ATM (BCA, Mandiri, BRI, BNI), e-KTP, atau SIM. Letakkan kartu tepat di atas bingkai kartu yang muncul di layar.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-auto pt-3 text-xs font-medium text-indigo-500 dark:text-cyan-400 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>Standar lebar kartu: 8.56 cm</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-600 text-white font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-md shadow-indigo-600/30">
            2
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-(--foreground)">Cocokkan Ukuran Layar</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-(--muted-foreground) leading-relaxed">
          Geser slider kalibrasi ke kiri atau ke kanan sampai tepi kotak digital di layar sejajar persis dengan tepi fisik kartu Anda. Klik <strong>"Simpan Kalibrasi"</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-auto pt-3 text-xs font-medium text-indigo-500 dark:text-cyan-400 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>Tersimpan otomatis di browser</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div class="relative flex flex-col space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-600 text-white font-black text-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-md shadow-indigo-600/30">
            3
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-(--foreground)">Ukur Objek Apapun</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-(--muted-foreground) leading-relaxed">
          Letakkan benda (misalnya sekrup, cincin, kunci, perhiasan, pensil, atau kartu pos) di atas penggaris. Geser pin penanda <strong>A</strong> dan <strong>B</strong> untuk membaca panjangnya secara instan.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-auto pt-3 text-xs font-medium text-indigo-500 dark:text-cyan-400 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>Tersedia salin 1-klik ke clipboard</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
